{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51554","headline":"咏虺汉（黄巢犯京後，守亮、守信等悉爲杨军容复恭义儿，势夺诸侯，亦一时之威也。归有不平之色咏虺汉以刺之曰：） · 归处讷","name":"咏虺汉（黄巢犯京後，守亮、守信等悉爲杨军容复恭义儿，势夺诸侯，亦一时之威也。归有不平之色咏虺汉以刺之曰：）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草头灰面恶形仪，尽是军容表里儿。\n昔日水牛攀角上，而今细马劈腰骑。\n钱多内藏犹嫌少，位等三公尚厌卑。\n更有一般堪笑处，镀金牙齿咬银匙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"归处讷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51554.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51554","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}